  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Oh shoot, I thought it was recording.",
      "start": 1.14,
      "end": 4.02
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, we're gonna restart this, okay.",
      "start": 4.32,
      "end": 6.18
    },
    {
      "text": "Failure is not the problem.",
      "start": 8.2,
      "end": 9.76
    },
    {
      "text": "You might be the problem.",
      "start": 10.32,
      "end": 11.44
    },
    {
      "text": "If you're watching this video,",
      "start": 11.92,
      "end": 13.16
    },
    {
      "text": "it's because there's a part of you",
      "start": 13.6,
      "end": 15.14
    },
    {
      "text": "that has some grand vision for your life.",
      "start": 15.14,
      "end": 17.62
    },
    {
      "text": "For how things are meant to be, your dream life.",
      "start": 18.0,
      "end": 20.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Perhaps you're driving the car that you've always wanted.",
      "start": 21.08,
      "end": 23.28
    },
    {
      "text": "You have the boyfriend, the girlfriend, the wife,",
      "start": 23.4,
      "end": 25.52
    },
    {
      "text": "the husband that you've always imagined.",
      "start": 25.9,
      "end": 27.78
    },
    {
      "text": "But for some reason, no matter how hard you work,",
      "start": 28.42,
      "end": 30.7
    },
    {
      "text": "that vision seems just out of reach.",
      "start": 30.7,
      "end": 33.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Well stick with me because today,",
      "start": 33.78,
      "end": 35.32
    },
    {
      "text": "we're gonna talk about how to make that a reality.",
      "start": 35.78,
      "end": 38.12
    },
    {
      "text": "How to bring your dream life into reality",
      "start": 38.3,
      "end": 40.52
    },
    {
      "text": "so that you can step into the life that you're meant to be.",
      "start": 40.52,
      "end": 43.26
    }
  ]
}